  35:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_exti.c ****     (+) Configurable Exti lines can be configured with 3 different triggers
  36:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_exti.c ****         (++) Rising
  37:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_exti.c ****         (++) Falling
  38:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_exti.c ****         (++) Both of them
