  53:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_exti.c ****     (#) Configure the EXTI line using HAL_EXTI_SetConfigLine().
  54:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_exti.c ****         (++) Choose the interrupt line number by setting "Line" member from
  55:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_exti.c ****              EXTI_ConfigTypeDef structure.
  56:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_exti.c ****         (++) Configure the interrupt and/or event mode using "Mode" member from
